#%Module
module-whatis	 "Loads cuda/12.8.0 module.

This module was build on Thu May 15 10:12:16 AM EDT 2025

The CUDA Toolkit (https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-toolkit) is a parallel computing platform and programming model invented by NVIDIA. It enables dramatic increases in computing performance by harnessing the power of the graphics processing unit (GPU).

The script used to build this module can be found here: https://github.com/northeastern-rc-software-modules/cuda-12.8.0

To load the module, type:
module load cuda/12.8.0
"

conflict	 cuda
setenv     CUDA_HOME /shared/EL9/explorer/cuda/12.8.0
setenv     CUDA_PATH /shared/EL9/explorer/cuda/12.8.0
setenv     CUDA_VERSION 12.8.0
prepend-path	 PATH /shared/EL9/explorer/cuda/12.8.0/bin
prepend-path	 MANPATH /shared/EL9/explorer/cuda/12.8.0/doc/man
prepend-path	 LD_LIBRARY_PATH /shared/EL9/explorer/cuda/12.8.0/lib64
prepend-path	 CPATH /shared/EL9/explorer/cuda/12.8.0/include
prepend-path	 LIBRARY_PATH /shared/EL9/explorer/cuda/12.8.0/lib64
